:''Not to be confused with [[Koneko (Uber Rare Cat)|Koneko]].''
'''Metal Maiden Koneko''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Best of the Best Milestone Edition (Gacha Event)|Best of the Best Milestone Edition]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]].

