==Trivia==
*Metal Maiden Koneko's name may be a reference to the English heavy metal band [[wikipedia:Iron Maiden|Iron Maiden]].
*Metal Maiden Koneko is the only [[Cat Units|Cat Unit]] with all three Slayer abilities.
*Metal Maiden Koneko is tied with [[Koneko (Uber Rare Cat)|Koneko]] for the cheapest cost of any obtainable [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]], at only 148¢.
*Koneko and Metal Maiden Koneko are one of the only pairs of [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]] to be "light/dark" counterparts outside of the [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]]/[[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] units, the other pair being [[Li'l Valkyrie (Uber Rare Cat)|Li'l Valkyrie]] and [[Li'l Valkyrie Dark (Uber Rare Cat)|Li'l Valkyrie Dark]].

